  "slug": "surrealdb-wasi-host-buffer",
  "title": "A guest memory limit does not cover host buffers",
  "description": "SurrealDB limited a module’s guest memory but buffered its unfinished output in unbounded host memory. A module could therefore exhaust the database process outside its configured ceiling.",
